# Net-Neutral AI — Complete Database ER Diagram

> **Share this with your team** — covers both the local per-session database and the central cloud database.

---

## Architecture Overview

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph "Per-Session (Local SQLite)"
        DB[(database.db)]
        CL[clients]
        RN[rounds]
        CR[credits]
        DB --- CL
        DB --- RN
        DB --- CR
    end

    subgraph "Lifetime (Supabase Cloud)"
        SB[(global_credits)]
    end

    CR -- "sync on session\ncomplete" --> SB
```

| Database | Engine | Location | Lifetime | Purpose |
|----------|--------|----------|----------|---------|
| `database.db` | SQLite | `coordinator/database.db` | Per training session (reset between runs) | Track contributions within a session |
| `global_credits` | PostgreSQL | Supabase cloud | Permanent | Accumulate lifetime credits across all sessions |

