## Local Database — `database.db`

### ER Diagram

```mermaid
erDiagram
    clients {
        INTEGER id PK "AUTOINCREMENT"
        TEXT client_id UK "NOT NULL, UNIQUE"
        TEXT ip_address "DEFAULT 'unknown'"
        DATETIME registered_at "DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP"
        DATETIME last_seen "DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP"
        BOOLEAN is_active "DEFAULT 1"
    }

    rounds {
        INTEGER id PK "AUTOINCREMENT"
        INTEGER round_number UK "NOT NULL, UNIQUE"
        DATETIME started_at "NOT NULL"
        DATETIME completed_at "DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP"
        INTEGER clients_submitted "DEFAULT 0"
        REAL global_accuracy "DEFAULT 0.0"
        REAL accuracy_delta "DEFAULT 0.0"
    }

    credits {
        INTEGER id PK "AUTOINCREMENT"
        TEXT client_id FK "NOT NULL"
        INTEGER round FK "NOT NULL"
        INTEGER samples_trained "DEFAULT 0"
        REAL time_seconds "DEFAULT 0.0"
        INTEGER points_earned "DEFAULT 0"
        DATETIME timestamp "DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP"
    }

    clients ||--o{ credits : "client_id FK, ON DELETE CASCADE"
    rounds ||--o{ credits : "round_number FK, ON DELETE CASCADE"
```

### Relationships

| Parent Table | Child Table | FK Column | Constraint | On Delete |
|-------------|-------------|-----------|------------|-----------|
| `clients.client_id` | `credits.client_id` | `client_id` | FOREIGN KEY | CASCADE |
| `rounds.round_number` | `credits.round` | `round` | FOREIGN KEY | CASCADE |

### Constraints

| Table | Constraint | Columns | Purpose |
|-------|-----------|---------|---------|
| `clients` | UNIQUE | `client_id` | No duplicate client registrations |
| `rounds` | UNIQUE | `round_number` | One record per round |
| `credits` | UNIQUE | `(client_id, round)` | One submission per client per round |
| All | FOREIGN KEYS ON | `PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON` | Enforced on every connection |

### Indexes

| Index Name | Table | Column(s) | Purpose |
|-----------|-------|-----------|---------|
| `idx_credits_client` | credits | `client_id` | Fast leaderboard queries |
| `idx_credits_round` | credits | `round` | Fast per-round lookups |
| `idx_clients_active` | clients | `is_active` | Fast active-client filtering |
| `sqlite_autoindex_rounds_1` | rounds | `round_number` | Auto from UNIQUE |

