## Cloud Database — Supabase `global_credits`

### Schema

```mermaid
erDiagram
    global_credits {
        UUID id PK "gen_random_uuid()"
        TEXT client_id UK "NOT NULL, UNIQUE"
        BIGINT total_points "DEFAULT 0"
        BIGINT total_samples "DEFAULT 0"
        INTEGER total_rounds "DEFAULT 0"
        TIMESTAMPTZ last_session_at "DEFAULT NOW()"
        TIMESTAMPTZ created_at "DEFAULT NOW()"
    }
```

### SQL Definition

```sql
CREATE TABLE global_credits (
    id              UUID        DEFAULT gen_random_uuid() PRIMARY KEY,
    client_id       TEXT        NOT NULL UNIQUE,
    total_points    BIGINT      NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
    total_samples   BIGINT      NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
    total_rounds    INTEGER     NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
    last_session_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW(),
    created_at      TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()
);

ALTER TABLE global_credits ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;

CREATE POLICY "Allow anonymous access" ON global_credits
    FOR ALL USING (true) WITH CHECK (true);
```

