## Sync Mechanism

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Clients
    participant S as Coordinator Server
    participant LDB as Local SQLite
    participant SDB as Supabase Cloud

    Note over S: Training Session Begins

    C->>S: POST /register (client_id, ip)
    S->>LDB: INSERT INTO clients

    loop For each round (1-5)
        C->>S: POST /submit (weights, samples, time)
        S->>LDB: INSERT INTO credits
        S->>LDB: INSERT INTO rounds (after FedAvg)
    end

    Note over S: round_status = 'done'

    S->>LDB: SELECT leaderboard (SUM points per client)
    LDB-->>S: [{client_A: 5000pts}, {client_B: 4500pts}, ...]

    S->>SDB: For each client: UPSERT global_credits
    Note over SDB: INCREMENT total_points,<br/>total_samples, total_rounds

    SDB-->>S: Sync complete (2/2 clients)
```

### Sync Rules

| Scenario | Action | Example |
|----------|--------|---------|
| Client's **first ever** session | INSERT new row | `client_A: 5000 pts, 25000 samples, 5 rounds` |
| Client has **existing** record | INCREMENT values | `client_A: 5000 + 4800 = 9800 pts` |
| Supabase **not configured** | Skip (non-fatal warning) | Credits saved locally only |
| Supabase **connection fails** | Skip (non-fatal warning) | Retry on next session |

