## Complete Data Flow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Client Starts] --> B[POST /register]
    B --> C[INSERT INTO clients table]
    B --> D[Add to in-memory registered_clients set]

    E[Training Round N] --> F[Client trains locally]
    F --> G[POST /submit weights + metadata]
    G --> H[INSERT INTO credits table]
    G --> I[Store weights in submitted_weights dict]

    I --> J{All clients submitted?}
    J -->|Yes| K[Run FedAvg Aggregation]
    K --> L[Evaluate global model]
    L --> M[INSERT INTO rounds table]
    M --> N{Round N >= 5?}

    N -->|No| O[Next round]
    O --> E

    N -->|Yes| P[Training Complete]
    P --> Q[Sync to Supabase global_credits]
    Q --> R[UPSERT per client: INCREMENT points]

    style C fill:#e1f5fe
    style H fill:#e1f5fe
    style M fill:#e1f5fe
    style Q fill:#fff3e0
    style R fill:#fff3e0
```

**Blue** = Local SQLite writes | **Orange** = Supabase cloud writes

